{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>By the sweat of your brow.</b> This is the nose, which sweats first during exertion. And this curse was fulfilled only upon those who work the soil, but 'in pain you shall bear children' was fulfilled upon all women, because Chava sinned and caused others to sin, and therefore her curse is greater." "<b>Until you return to the ground.</b> But once he returns to his dust and dies, the decree is nullified, as he explained."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {1 "ומת בטל גזירה — rendered as 'and dies, the decree is nullified'; כמו שפי׳ (כמו שפירש) 'as he explained' is left without specifying a referent, following the source text."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:46.443098470Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}